The contributions from uncountable people have been very helpful
throughout the many years GNU Chess has been around. It is simply
beyond any reach to track such a long record.

Thank you all GNU Chess friends!

In the age of series v6, the following people have contributed in
different ways, like providing reports, support, ideas, fixes or using
the program in various contexts. They are listed approximately in
chronological order. Please let us know if you have been left out,
if your name is misspelled or if you'd rather not be listed.

